<p>Summon a Dread of level <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>character level 50">44, 46, 48, 50, 52</acronym> that will annoyingly blink around, hexing your foes.</p><p>It knows the following spells:</p><ul><li> Burning Hex at level <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5</acronym></li><li> Empathic Hex at level <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5</acronym></li><li> Pacification Hex at level <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5</acronym></li><li> Blur Sight at level <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym></li><li> Phase Door at level <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5</acronym></li></ul><p></p>